window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>When tasked with tracking down the mate you never wanted, nothing ever goes as planned.</i></b><br> <br> <i>Foster</i><br> Ten years ago, one bad choice lost me my pack. Since then, I’ve been a rogue wolf, and I’m content to stay that way until the Moon Goddess shows up and tells me to find my mate.<br> <br> One look at her and two things become very clear.<br> <br> She’s no wolf and...she has no idea who I am.<br> <br> <i>Andie</i><br> It’s not every day you find out you’re a witch that's mated to a wolf. To be fair, I was already beginning to question if magic might be real. I know, it sounds crazy—but what other explanation is there for this strange glowing light coming from my hands?<br> <br> When a couple of witches attack me, I’m thrust into a life I’d once been forced to forget.<br> <br> Turns out there’s a lot more than magic that’s been waiting for me. All I have to do is take the chance and embrace it.<br> <br> But can I give up everything I am for a coven and soulmate I never knew existed?<br> <br> <i>This complete wolf shifter and witch series includes three stories plus bonus content. Each story is told in dual POV from our two main characters!<br> <br> Fated to the Wolf is perfect for fans of slow burn paranormal romance with a relatable heroine, a swoon worthy love interest, humor, and heart. This is the fourth series in the Mystics and Mayhem universe, but they can be listened to in any order.</i></p>"; 
